        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Winstone\n- Products: Cold Mountain, Nil By Mouth, King Arthur, The Magic Roundabout, The Departed, Beowulf, Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull, Edge of Darkness, The Sweeney, Noah, Doogal, The Lord of the Springs\n- Places: France, United States\n- Concepts: film release titles, redubbing\n- Topics: computer-animated adventure fantasy films, television adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Winstone has appeared in the films \"Cold Mountain,\" \"Nil By Mouth,\" \"King Arthur,\" \"The Magic Roundabout,\" \"The Departed,\" \"Beowulf,\" \"Indiana Jones and the Kingdom of the Crystal Skull,\" \"Edge of Darkness,\" \"The Sweeney,\" and \"Noah.\"\n- \"The Magic Roundabout\" is a 2005 French-British computer-animated adventure fantasy film.\n- \"The Magic Roundabout\" was released in France as \"Pollux - Le manège enchanté.\"\n- \"The Magic Roundabout\" was redubbed in the United States as \"Doogal\" or \"The Lord of the Springs.\"\n- \"The Magic Roundabout\" is based on the television series \"The Magic Roundabout.\"",
